        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Nasal speech</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Nasal voice</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0001611</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>May be associated with incomplete or weak closure of the velum. Examination is by nasal endoscopy.</rdfs:comment>
