        <rdfs:comment>A disorder of the foot that can either be congenital or acquired. Such deformities can include hammer toe, club foot deformity, flat feet, pes cavus, congenital vertical talus (rocker bottom foot), and many others.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">Anomalie de la morphologie du pied</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
