        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Muscle weakness, distal</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Muscle weakness, distal limbs, due to neuronopathy</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Weakness of distal muscles</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
